{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30131","headline":"和郑先辈谢秩闲居寓书所怀 · 刘得仁","name":"和郑先辈谢秩闲居寓书所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西风日夜吹，万木共离披。\n近甸新晴後，高人得意时。\n暂闲心亦泰，论道面难欺。\n把笔还诗债，将琴当酒资。\n蓝衫悬竹桁，乌帽挂松枝。\n名占文章重，官归谏宪迟。\n生涯贫帝里，公议到台司。\n室冷沾苔藓，门清绝路岐。\n莫言邻白屋，即贺立丹墀。\n岂虑尘埃久，云霄故有期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}